WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:19.769
Ok, now, parfaits go on that table,
and the bognog goes over there.

2
00:00:19.936 --> 00:00:23.148
Make sure the pies and cookies
are arranged in fun holiday shapes!

3
00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:25.692
Oh, man, Shrek, I just love this.
Don't you just love this?

4
00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.528
- Sure, Donkey.
- This is the best Christmas party ever.

5
00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:31.406
Because this year, everybody's gonna
sing their favorite Christmas carol.

6
00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:34.034
I hear even the Shrek family
is gonna sing.

7
00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:35.785
- Oh, yeah.
- Yeah!

8
00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:39.664
No more bognog for him.

9
00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:43.043
<i>It's my most favorite time of the year</i>

10
00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:49.049
<i>With the parties and carols
and cider in barrels for everyone here</i>

11
00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:52.427
Hey, Shrek, check it out! I found
a real Christmas elf out in the garbage!

12
00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.597
I'm not an elf, I'm Rumpelstiltskin.
Let me out of this cage!

13
00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:58.350
So you can run away again?
I don't think so.

14
00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:02.062
Hey, Wolf. You like that?
It's a mega-size Santa replica.

15
00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:06.233
Made from a new magic called...
"plastic."

16
00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.943
Yeah, it's freaking me out.

17
00:01:08.109 --> 00:01:10.946
Hey, Pigs, you gotta try
dragon-spicy reindeer apple balls.

18
00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:13.365
No, thank you.
We are on a diet.

19
00:01:13.531 --> 00:01:14.866
We are chubby buddies.

20
00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.451
We are getting ready for...

21
00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:18.370
Swimsuit weather!

22
00:01:18.954 --> 00:01:21.748
Move it along, pigs.
Nothing to eat here.

23
00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:25.961
You guys, this is not a place to take
a nap! Wake up, wake up!

24
00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:29.130
<i>It's the warm-fluffiest season of all</i>

25
00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:33.134
<i>Where the fun never ends
and my closest of friends</i>

26
00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:35.178
<i>Are packed here in the hall</i>

27
00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:39.266
<i>I'll be shocked
if this don't end in a brawl</i>

28
00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.978
Attention, attention, attention,
everybody!

29
00:01:43.144 --> 00:01:46.398
I want to thank all of you for coming
out to my holiday extravaganza,

30
00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:48.066
caroling Christmas-tacular.

31
00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.110
I hope you've been
brushing up on your singing

32
00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:52.237
more than Gretched brushes her teeth.

33
00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:54.239
Teeth aren't needed.

34
00:01:54.406 --> 00:01:55.573
<i>There'll be apples for bobbing</i>

35
00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:57.033
<i>- Old fruitcake!
- And sobbing</i>

36
00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.035
<i>And games filled with holiday fun</i>

37
00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.412
<i>- There'll be candy
- And presents</i>

38
00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:05.709
<i>- Roast turkey and pheasant!
- And stockings for everyone</i>

39
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.962
<i>It's my most favorite time of the year</i>

40
00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:12.799
<i>And you won't wanna leave
'Cause if you all believe</i>

41
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:15.010
<i>Santa soon will be here</i>

42
00:02:15.176 --> 00:02:17.637
<i>It's my most favoritest time</i>

43
00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.514
<i>Where did you learn how to rhyme?</i>

44
00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:24.019
<i>Christmas is my favorite time</i>

45
00:02:24.185 --> 00:02:27.689
<i>Of the year</i>

46
00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:29.149
<i>Yeah!</i>

47
00:02:31.192 --> 00:02:34.654
Man, that felt good.
Now, who's gonna sing next? Anybody?

48
00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:37.032
Ok. Well, then I guess
I'll sing another.

49
00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.372
<i>Stirring our big pot</i>

50
00:02:44.539 --> 00:02:47.042
<i>Full of goodies for our snack</i>

51
00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:49.419
<i>Fungus and tree rot</i>

52
00:02:49.586 --> 00:02:51.087
<i>Stink bugs by the stack</i>

53
00:02:51.921 --> 00:02:53.715
<i>How we like to eat</i>

54
00:02:53.882 --> 00:02:56.051
<i>Worms and grubs and slop</i>

55
00:02:56.217 --> 00:03:00.138
<i>It brings such joy and is a treat
With pickled skunk on top</i>

56
00:03:00.305 --> 00:03:03.099
<i>So bug cocoon
Lick the spoon</i>

57
00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:05.060
<i>Try our cricket slurp</i>

58
00:03:05.643 --> 00:03:07.312
<i>And how I just love rat pie</i>

59
00:03:07.479 --> 00:03:09.898
<i>It always makes me burp</i>

60
00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.150
<i>Serve a toad, à la mode</i>

61
00:03:12.317 --> 00:03:14.569
<i>Roadkill tastes so fine</i>

62
00:03:14.736 --> 00:03:18.990
<i>Pigeon wings and spider strings
'tis the perfect way to dine</i>

63
00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:24.204
Back in my village, the holiday season
was all about the <i>turón,</i>

64
00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:28.416
dancing the flamenco, and
the bittersweet serenade of this song.

65
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.669
<i>Fleas Navidad</i>

66
00:03:33.004 --> 00:03:35.048
<i>Fleas Navidad</i>

67
00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:39.177
<i>I got Fleas Navidad
My coat is itching</i>

68
00:03:39.344 --> 00:03:41.221
<i>And my eyes go sad</i>

69
00:03:42.305 --> 00:03:45.392
<i>I want a cleansing flea dip
for Christmas</i>

70
00:03:45.558 --> 00:03:48.353
<i>A fine leather flea collar
for Christmas</i>

71
00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.481
<i>A nice shampoo
and fluffing for Christmas</i>

72
00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:55.443
<i>To make the itching stop</i>

73
00:04:00.615 --> 00:04:03.743
- Don't mind if I do.
- Not on my watch!

74
00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:07.288
Hey, they're just cookies!
It's not like they're real.

75
00:04:07.455 --> 00:04:10.417
What do you know about being real?

76
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.710
Nothing.

77
00:04:12.877 --> 00:04:16.339
All right, everyone.
Let's wrap it up!

78
00:04:20.844 --> 00:04:23.596
<i>Fairy tale, fairy tale,
merry tale fun</i>

79
00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:26.433
<i>Happily after and happily done</i>

80
00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:29.310
<i>Snow men, you know, men
and donkeys that speak</i>

81
00:04:29.477 --> 00:04:31.563
<i>And a puppet boy made of teak</i>

82
00:04:31.729 --> 00:04:34.566
<i>Abracadabra, cook-ity doo</i>

83
00:04:34.732 --> 00:04:37.360
<i>Home by midnight
'cause Santa is due</i>

84
00:04:37.527 --> 00:04:40.071
<i>Cheeses that pleases
that stink really bad</i>

85
00:04:40.238 --> 00:04:42.240
<i>That makes Christmas glad</i>

86
00:04:42.407 --> 00:04:45.285
<i>I'll confetti ya with poinsettia</i>

87
00:04:45.452 --> 00:04:47.745
<i>As we all trim the tree</i>

88
00:04:47.912 --> 00:04:51.166
<i>Pussy cat time
Boots and hat time</i>

89
00:04:51.332 --> 00:04:53.501
<i>And a stocking full of coal for me</i>

90
00:04:53.668 --> 00:04:55.170
<i>Higgety-piggety</i>

91
00:04:55.336 --> 00:04:56.379
<i>- Ogre roar now
- Roar!</i>

92
00:04:56.546 --> 00:04:59.007
<i>Shake the rafters loud</i>

93
00:04:59.174 --> 00:05:01.843
<i>Huff in' and a puffin'
in a granny's frock</i>

94
00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:04.762
<i>That's the fairy tale
That's a merry tale</i>

95
00:05:04.929 --> 00:05:08.600
<i>That's the fairy tale rock</i>

96
00:05:11.561 --> 00:05:13.897
Come on, everyone,
I'm busting you out!

97
00:05:14.063 --> 00:05:16.149
No one's gonna eat you this year!

98
00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:18.026
<i>Merry Christmas!</i>

99
00:05:18.526 --> 00:05:22.030
<i>And thanks for making
my caroling party Christmas-tacular!</i>
